     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«わけではない» denies an absolute conclusion, but may leave part of the idea standing.",
     "texto": [
      "«AはBというわけではない» = doesn't necessarily mean A is B. Avoid translating it as a flat \"no\" if the context softens it.",
      "利用者 が 少ない から と いって、サービス が 不要 な わけ では ありません。 (Just because there are few users doesn't mean the service is unnecessary.)",
